---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Services | One Take Wonder Marketing"
  description="Full-service marketing agency. TV & OTT advertising, digital marketing, creative & web design, campaign-only options, and full marketing department outsourcing. Over 10 years of proven ROI."
>

<!-- Page Hero -->
<section class="bg-gray-900 py-20 px-6">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto text-center">
    <p class="text-brand-pink-light font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-sm mb-4">Our Services</p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white mb-6">Whatever Your Marketing Needs, <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-pink-light to-brand-pink bg-clip-text text-transparent">We Can Handle It</span></h1>
    <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      From a single campaign to your entire marketing department — we scale to fit your business, your budget, and your goals.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- FULL SERVICE MARKETING -->
<section id="full-service" class="py-20 px-6 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
      <div>
        <p class="section-label">Flagship Service</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-6">Full Service Marketing <span class="gradient-text">Department</span></h2>
        <p class="text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Outsource your entire marketing function to One Take Wonder. We become your marketing department — handling strategy, creative, media buying, analytics, and reporting across every channel. You get an experienced team without the overhead of hiring in-house.
        </p>
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-pink flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Complete Marketing Strategy</h4>
              <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Annual and quarterly planning aligned to your business goals.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-pink flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Multi-Channel Execution</h4>
              <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">TV, OTT, digital, social, print, radio — we run it all.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-pink flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Transparent ROI Reporting</h4>
              <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Monthly reports that connect every dollar to actual results.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-pink flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Dedicated Account Team</h4>
              <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">A strategist, creative lead, and media buyer assigned to your account.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-gray-900 rounded-2xl p-10 text-white">
        <p class="text-brand-pink-light text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Best For</p>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Growing Businesses Ready to Scale</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-300 mb-6">Ideal for businesses that need marketing leadership and execution but aren't ready to build an in-house team. We handle it all — so you can focus on running your business.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary block text-center">Get a Free Proposal</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- TRADITIONAL ADVERTISING -->
<section id="traditional" class="py-20 px-6 bg-gray-50">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <p class="section-label">Traditional & Broadcast</p>
      <h2 class="section-heading mb-4">TV, OTT & <span class="gradient-text">Broadcast Advertising</span></h2>
      <p class="text-gray-500 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        From traditional television to streaming platforms, we place your message where your audience is watching.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-brand-pink/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
          <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-brand-pink" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 10l4.553-2.276A1 1 0 0121 8.618v6.764a1 1 0 01-1.447.894L15 14M5 18h8a2 2 0 002-2V8a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v8a2 2 0 002 2z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Broadcast TV</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 leading-relaxed text-sm">Local and regional broadcast television campaigns with professional production, strategic media buying, and precise audience targeting.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-brand-pink/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
          <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-brand-pink" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9.75 17L9 20l-1 1h8l-1-1-.75-3M3 13h18M5 17h14a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">OTT & Streaming TV</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 leading-relaxed text-sm">Connected TV advertising on Hulu, Roku, YouTube TV, and other streaming platforms with advanced targeting capabilities.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-brand-pink/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
          <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-brand-pink" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 11a7 7 0 01-7 7m0 0a7 7 0 01-7-7m7 7v4m0 0H8m4 0h4m-4-8a3 3 0 01-3-3V5a3 3 0 116 0v6a3 3 0 01-3 3z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Radio & Audio</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 leading-relaxed text-sm">Terrestrial radio, satellite, streaming audio, and podcast advertising — reaching listeners during their daily routines.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- DIGITAL MARKETING -->
<section id="digital" class="py-20 px-6 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <p class="section-label">Digital</p>
      <h2 class="section-heading mb-4"><span class="gradient-text">Digital Marketing</span> That Converts</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-500 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Data-driven digital strategies that connect with your audience at every stage of their journey.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
      <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">SEO</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Search engine optimization that puts your business in front of people actively looking for what you offer.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Paid Search (PPC)</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Google Ads and Bing campaigns built around high-intent keywords and optimized for conversions.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Social Media Ads</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Facebook, Instagram, TikTok, and LinkedIn advertising with audience targeting that maximizes reach.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Email Marketing</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Automated email campaigns that nurture leads, retain customers, and drive repeat business.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Social Media Management</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Content calendars, community management, and consistent posting across all your social platforms.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Content Marketing</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Blog posts, articles, videos, and downloadable content that builds authority and attracts customers.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Online Video Ads</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Pre-roll, mid-roll, and in-stream video advertising on YouTube and across the web.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Analytics & Reporting</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Custom dashboards and monthly reports that show exactly what's working — and what's driving ROI.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CREATIVE & WEB -->
<section id="creative" class="py-20 px-6 bg-gray-50">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <p class="section-label">Creative & Production</p>
      <h2 class="section-heading mb-4">Creative Services & <span class="gradient-text">Web Design</span></h2>
      <p class="text-gray-500 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        The creative assets and digital experiences that bring your campaigns to life.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200 text-center">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-brand-pink/10 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-5 mx-auto">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-brand-pink" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M7 21a4 4 0 01-4-4V5a2 2 0 012-2h4a2 2 0 012 2v12a4 4 0 01-4 4zm0 0h12a2 2 0 002-2v-4a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2.343M11 7.343l1.657-1.657a2 2 0 012.828 0l2.829 2.829a2 2 0 010 2.828l-8.486 8.485M7 17h.01"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Website Design</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Custom websites built for performance, conversions, and mobile-first experiences.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200 text-center">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-brand-pink/10 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-5 mx-auto">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-brand-pink" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 16l4.586-4.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L16 16m-2-2l1.586-1.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L20 14m-6-6h.01M6 20h12a2 2 0 002-2V6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Graphic Design</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Brand identity, logos, print materials, digital assets, and campaign creative.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200 text-center">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-brand-pink/10 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-5 mx-auto">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-brand-pink" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 10l4.553-2.276A1 1 0 0121 8.618v6.764a1 1 0 01-1.447.894L15 14M5 18h8a2 2 0 002-2V8a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v8a2 2 0 002 2z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Video Production</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">TV commercials, social media videos, brand films, and testimonial content.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200 text-center">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-brand-pink/10 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-5 mx-auto">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-brand-pink" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M11 5H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v11a2 2 0 002 2h11a2 2 0 002-2v-5m-1.414-9.414a2 2 0 112.828 2.828L11.828 15H9v-2.828l8.586-8.586z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Copywriting</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Website copy, ad scripts, blog content, email sequences — words that sell.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CAMPAIGN-ONLY -->
<section id="campaign" class="py-20 px-6 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <p class="section-label">Flexible Options</p>
      <h2 class="section-heading mb-4">Campaign-Only <span class="gradient-text">Engagements</span></h2>
      <p class="text-gray-500 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Not ready for a full retainer? We offer single-campaign and project-based engagements for specific needs.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200 text-center">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Single TV Campaign</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mb-4">One broadcast or OTT campaign from concept to air. Production, media buying, and reporting included.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn-secondary text-sm !py-2 !px-6">Inquire</a>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200 text-center">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Website Redesign</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mb-4">A complete website overhaul — design, development, content, and launch. Mobile-first and conversion-optimized.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn-secondary text-sm !py-2 !px-6">Inquire</a>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200 text-center">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Custom Project</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mb-4">Have a specific need? Let's talk. We build custom scopes for any marketing challenge you're facing.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn-secondary text-sm !py-2 !px-6">Inquire</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA -->
<section class="py-20 px-6 bg-gray-900">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white mb-6">
      Not Sure What You Need?
    </h2>
    <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg mb-10">
      That's what we're here for. Tell us about your business and we'll recommend the right approach — no pressure, no obligation.
    </p>
    <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary text-lg !px-10 !py-4">Start the Conversation</a>
  </div>
</section>

</Layout>
